<title>SWITZERLAND: WELLA nine-months profit off, sales up.</title>
<headline>WELLA nine-months profit off, sales up.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZURICH, Nov 19 (Reuter) Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated).</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   84.4	  88.1</p>
<p>    Group sales			2,754.8     2,497.6</p>
<p>    - domestic			 810.7	 805.3</p>
<p>    - foreign sales		  1,944.1     1,693.3</p>
<p>    Fixed asset investments	80.0	  75.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Wella AG. Press conference to present full 1996 results will be held April 22, 1997, in Darmstadt. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
